request.description:
Returns availability-utilization metrics for the solver: future available hours, booking counts, 7-day utilization, 6-month trend, peak hours and booking-type mix.

**Auth:** True | **Roles:** solver | **CSRF header:** no
**Middleware that runs:** AuthMiddleware; RequireRole(solver); TimezoneMiddleware; RequireFeatureAccess(availability)
**Handler:** `Backend/internal/adapter/http/handlers/solver_extended_handler.go:52 SolverExtendedHandler.GetAvailabilityAnalytics`

**Response 200** (application/json) - field types from code:
```json
{
  "success": "boolean",
  "data": {
    "booked_slots": "integer (COUNT of all the solver's bookings not cancelled/declined, all time)",
    "available_slots": "integer (total HOURS of availability windows ending in the future, truncated)",
    "utilization_percentage": "number (booked_slots / available_slots * 100; 0 when available_slots is 0)",
    "weekly_availability": {
      "total_hours": "integer (window hours starting in the next 7 days)",
      "booked_hours": "integer (SUM booked duration_minutes in next 7 days / 60)",
      "utilization_rate": "integer (booked_hours/total_hours*100)"
    },
    "monthly_trends": [
      {
        "month": "string (\"Jan\"..\"Dec\")",
        "sessions": "integer",
        "hours": "integer"
      }
    ],
    "peak_hours": [
      {
        "time": "string (\"HH24:00\", DB session timezone)",
        "bookings": "integer"
      }
    ],
    "student_preferences": {
      "<booking_type>": "integer (percentage of non-cancelled bookings)"
    }
  }
}
```
_monthly_trends covers the current month and the previous 5 that have bookings; peak_hours top 5 by count; arrays/map never null. Cached by the cached repository._

**Endpoint-specific errors**
- 403: `This feature is currently restricted for your account | This feature is temporarily unavailable platform-wide | This feature is temporarily unavailable for your role` - RequireFeatureAccess(availability): feature blocked for the user (source user) / platform_all / platform_seeker|platform_solver; body also has restricted: true, feature: "availability", source, optional reason, expires_at (RFC3339) or permanent: true
- 500: `Failed to get availability analytics` - any query/scan fails

**Side effects:** none (read-only)

**Live check 2026-10-06:** body_verified - solver -> 200 (matches doc)

**Listed in:** solver: `GET /api/v1/solver/availability/analytics` (docs/audit/solver_endpoints.md:24)
**Evidence:** `Backend/internal/adapter/http/routes/routes.go:794`, `Backend/internal/adapter/http/routes/routes.go:1179`, `Backend/internal/adapter/http/handlers/solver_extended_handler.go:52-65`, `Backend/internal/core/usecases/solver_extended_service.go:94-96`, `Backend/internal/adapter/db/postgres/solver_extended_repository.go:136-270`, `Backend/internal/core/domain/solver_extended_dto.go:81-112`, `Backend/internal/adapter/cache/solver_extended_repository.go:75-95`

